          </figure>
          <h4>Example 4: Publication year range</h4>
          <p>Filter records by year interval using the configured range facet field.</p>
          <figure class="api-snippet api-snippet--docmost" aria-label="Catalog publication year range example">
            <figcaption>
              <span class="api-snippet__label">Code</span>
